What this means: if you drop a ring on a sink, it will disappear down
the drain, and you will get an obscure message reflecting what type of
ring it was.  IMHO, this isn't terribly useful unless you have two
rings of the same type and want to know what they are.  Try kicking a
sink sometime, but note that this can be dangerous for low level
characters.
